# Embedded runtime trees are GENERATED copies of canonical sources, not
# hand-edited files. The canonical sources live above the embedding Go
# package, and go:embed cannot reach a parent directory, so `make build`
# copies them down (see Makefile sync_tree + docs/audits/sync-audit.md).
#
# linguist-generated:
#   - collapses these paths in GitHub diffs/reviews (they're noise — the
#     real change is in the canonical source),
#   - excludes them from language stats.
# Edit the canonical source (schemas/, controls/, data/alternatives/),
# then `make sync-schemas` / `sync-controls` / `sync-alternatives`.
internal/contracts/schema/embedded/**      linguist-generated=true
internal/controldata/embedded/**           linguist-generated=true
internal/adapters/coverage/embedded/**     linguist-generated=true
